      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Batch neural style transfer with generic cv2.dnn nodes (mosaic-9.onnx)\n\nDNN Blob From Image    (encodes the whole IMAGE batch into one (N,C,H,W) blob)\n -> DNN Forward         (single batched forward pass)\n -> DNN Images From Blob (unpacks to (N,H,W,C) batch)\n -> Index Batch          (pick frame 0 for display)\n -> CV Cast Array        (clip to uint8)\n -> CV Array -> Image    (RGB)\n\nNOTE: Most ONNX models accept only batch=1. If your model errors with a multi-frame batch, fall back to the single-image workflow 41."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
